@startuml overview
' cumin-works - when cumin notifies. Each cause is notified once.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

left to right direction

rectangle "a person needs to decide\n(awaiting-plan-review, awaiting-merge-decision,\nawaiting-acceptance, awaiting-decision)" as Decide
rectangle "something is wrong\n(a label it does not take, no single Assignee,\nan issue it cannot read whole, an unread usage,\na failed tool check, failed polls)" as Wrong
rectangle "a usage limit is reached" as Limit
rectangle "no issue to take next" as Waits

rectangle "notify once:\na link and one line of the reason" as Notify
rectangle "the issue and the pull request\nhold the details and the talk" as GitHub

Decide --> Notify
Wrong --> Notify
Limit --> Notify
Waits --> Notify
Notify --> GitHub : the reader goes to

@enduml
